  "rule": "Candidate WF2_finetune_v1; released baseline is immutable. Target >=0.90 pooled water IoU over all valid pixels on the same test tiles; this is an aim, not a promised result. Train only from pinned WorldFloodsv2 train split, excluding exact eval scene names and all train EMSR activations represented in val/test. No val/test labels or masks used for gradient updates. Fine-tune all UNet weights from the released checkpoint. Train grid256/stride256, >=50% valid labels; dihedral transforms and modest radiometric augmentation; masked water BCE+soft Dice and auxiliary cloud BCE. AdamW, encoder LR5e-6/decoderLR5e-5, cosine decay, batch8, seed42. Up to16 epochs,512 optimizer steps per epoch, validation after each; early stop after4 epochs without eligible improvement. Select highest validation pooled water IoU, provided clear/cloudy validation IoU each stays within1 point of the frozen baseline. Fixed threshold0.5; no test-based checkpoint or threshold selection. Once selection is locked, evaluate test once and run composition, same-tile cloud/non-cloud paste and named scene aggregation controls. Existing test data were inspected in the earlier audit; they are not a newly blind benchmark. All new JSON under results/finetune_v1; new weights under checkpoints/finetune_v1.",
